I've been pondering the idea of taking digitized pictures of the Tiny Toons
characters, tracing them, and converting them into icons for NetHack (I have
the 3.0j version for the Amiga.)  That explains the wierd crossposting.  At
least, I hope it does.  (:3  Anyway, I have three questions:

* Has anyone done this, or something similar, before?  I'd like to save
  myself some work, if possible.

* Would anyone out there be willing to help me by sending me digitized frames
  from the show?  I don't have my own digitizer.

* What frames would you recommend for the icons?  So far, my choices are:

Archaeologist - Buster Bunny, natch, in Indy garb.
Barbarian     - Dizzy, eating something.  Something big.
Caveman       - Prehistoric Monty, banging his club.
Elf           - Tough call.  Furball, maybe?
Healer        - Elmyra, in her nurse's outfit.  (:3
Knight        - Plucky.  That is, *Sir* Plucky.
Priest        - Shirley, meditating.
Rouge         - Plucky, swiping something?
Samurai       - Hamton, as a Samurai Slug.
Tourist       - Gogo, with loud shirt and camera.
Valkyrie      - Babs, yes, but in what pose?
Wizard        - Babs again, as Tinkerbunny.  Or maybe Shirley.

Any suggestions, comments, flames, etc. are more than welcome!
